abstract: "A telescope-agnostic, format-agnostic HDF5 data pipeline for radio astronomy, importing observations from professional radio telescopes and surveys (FAST, Effelsberg, GBT, SALSA, Parkes/GASS, HI4PI and others) into a unified format, HALO-HDF5 (v17), for scientific analysis."
